    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "You are the grant-evaluation analyst for AIRI Foundation, a Canadian AI-literacy nonprofit.\n\nAIRI profile (mission, values, focus, and RED LINES it declines on principle):\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.airi) }}\n\nFunding opportunity:\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nFunder: {{ $json.funder }}\nAmount: {{ $json.amount }} {{ $json.currency }}\nDeadline: {{ $json.deadline }}\nCountry: {{ $json.country }}\nDescription: {{ $json.description }}\nURL: {{ $json.url }}\n\nThe SINGLE MOST IMPORTANT question is whether this genuinely aligns with what AIRI stands for — its\nmission and values — not merely whether it mentions AI. If it conflicts with any of AIRI's values or\nred lines, mark mission_alignment \"misaligned\" regardless of topical overlap or how attractive the money is.\n\nReason step by step, then output ONLY a JSON object (no markdown, no text outside the JSON):\n{\n  \"summary\": \"1-2 plain sentences: what this grant funds and who the funder is\",\n  \"mission_alignment\": \"aligned\" | \"partial\" | \"misaligned\",\n  \"mission_score\": integer 0-100,\n  \"approval_reasons\": [ \"concrete reasons AIRI should pursue this, EACH tied to a specific AIRI focus area, value, or mission point\" ],\n  \"watch_outs\": [ \"risks, caveats, unknowns, effort concerns, or strings-attached the reviewer should weigh; empty array if none\" ],\n  \"values_conflicts\": [ short strings, empty array if none ],\n  \"alignment_score\": integer 0-100,\n  \"capacity_fit\": short string,\n  \"effort_estimate\": \"low\" | \"medium\" | \"high\",\n  \"reasoning\": \"2-3 sentence justification\",\n  \"recommendation\": \"pursue\" | \"skip\"\n}\nOnly genuinely aligned AND eligible opportunities should reach alignment_score 80+. Be strict.\nWrite approval_reasons and watch_outs so a busy reviewer can decide in under a minute without reading the source."
      },
      "id": "085b301f-899d-479a-b297-b1a75b5e2cee",
      "name": "Evaluate Opportunity",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        -80,
        288
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\nconst raw=($json.text ?? $json.output ?? \"\").toString();\nconst cleaned=raw.replace(/```json/gi,\"\").replace(/```/g,\"\").trim();\nlet ev;\ntry { ev=JSON.parse(cleaned); }\ncatch(e){ ev={ summary:\"\", mission_alignment:\"misaligned\", mission_score:0, approval_reasons:[], watch_outs:[\"Model output could not be parsed as JSON\"],\n               values_conflicts:[\"Model output could not be parsed as JSON\"], alignment_score:0, reasoning:\"Unparseable model output.\", recommendation:\"skip\" }; }\nconst base=$('Hard Eligibility Gate').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  ...base,\n  mission_alignment: (ev.mission_alignment||\"misaligned\").toLowerCase(),\n  mission_score: Number(ev.mission_score)||0,\n  values_conflicts: ev.values_conflicts||[],\n  alignment_score: Number(ev.alignment_score)||0,\n  capacity_fit: ev.capacity_fit||\"\",\n  effort_estimate: ev.effort_estimate||\"unknown\",\n  summary: ev.summary||\"\",\n  approval_reasons: Array.isArray(ev.approval_reasons)?ev.approval_reasons:[],\n  watch_outs: Array.isArray(ev.watch_outs)?ev.watch_outs:[],\n  eval_reasoning: ev.reasoning||\"\",\n  recommendation: ev.recommendation||\"skip\"\n}}];\n"
      },
